</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">성적 장학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">금오공과대학교 재학생으로 평점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">총평점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4.0 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">이상이며 품행이 바르고 타의 보범이되는 학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">편입생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">대학원생 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;3)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">공로 장학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">동창회 및 학생회 활동에 공로가 많은 자</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3.5</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">이상</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;4) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">모교 장학금 수령자 및  본회 장학금 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">회 신청하여 수령자는 제외된다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span><br> <br> <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">신청서 교부처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">총동창회사무실&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-fami